{"id":"n4-019","title":"Noun + 中 (Noun + ちゅう)","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express 'in the middle of', 'during', or 'in the process of'.","longExplanation":"The 中 (ちゅう) grammar point is used to express that something is in the middle of, during, or in the process of happening. It is attached to a noun to convey this meaning (e.g., 勉強中, 仕事中, 会議中). It is also sometimes read as じゅう depending on the word (e.g., 授業中).","formation":"Noun + 中 (ちゅう)","examples":[{"jp":"彼は仕事中です。","romaji":"Kare wa shigotochuu desu.","en":"He is in the middle of work.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"中","vocabId":"1423310","reading":"なか"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"試験中、携帯電話を使ってはいけません。","romaji":"Shiken chuu, keitai denwa wo tsukatte wa ikemasen.","en":"During the exam, you must not use your mobile phone.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"中","vocabId":"1423310","reading":"なか"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"携帯","vocabId":"1250680","reading":"けいたい"},{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"使っ","vocabId":"1305990","reading":"つかう"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いけ","vocabId":"1421700","reading":"いけ"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"映画を観ている最中に、彼は泣き始めました。","romaji":"Eiga o mite iru saichuu ni, kare wa naki hajimemashita.","en":"In the middle of watching the movie, he started to cry.","words":[{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"観","vocabId":"1214770","reading":"かん"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"最中","vocabId":"1579210","reading":"さいちゅう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泣き","vocabId":"1229650","reading":"なき"},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女は今勉強中です。","romaji":"Kanojo wa ima benkyouchuu desu.","en":"She is currently studying.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"中","vocabId":"1423310","reading":"なか"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}